// =====================================================================
//  AUTONAV v4 - ESP-B : ROBOT 2   (MAC 0C:DC:7E:1B:6E:70)
//  Team Gradient Ascent | SIH 2026
//
//  What this robot does, in a loop until it reaches its goal:
//    1. Gets a goal (and optionally a start cell) typed into ESP-C
//    2. Plans the SHORTEST path with A*
//    3. Sends its full plan to the other robot and to ESP-C (ESP-NOW)
//    4. Both robots check the two plans step-by-step for a collision
//    5. If one is predicted: a shared coin flip picks ONE robot, which
//       treats the collision cell as an OBSTACLE and replans -> back to 3
//    6. When both plans are collision-free (and ESP-C said GO), both
//       robots take ONE step together, then repeat from 4
//  Movement is simulated (position update). Motor code: see doMove().
//  Needs ESP32 Arduino core 3.x.
// =====================================================================
